  "about_item": [
    "【Effective Flea & Tick Collar for Dogs】This flea and tick collar protects the dogs at the source. By interrupting the life cycle of fleas and ticks, it proactively defends your dog against fleas, ticks, mites, lice, and mosquitoes. It delivers continuous, gentle protection, helping your beloved pet stay comfortable and healthy every single day",
    "【40 Months of Long-Lasting Protection】This flea and tick prevention set includes 5 collar—each dog flea collar provides up to 8 months of protection, totaling 40 months of continuous defense against fleas and ticks. It helps dogs prevent fleas, mites, mosquitoes, ticks, and lice 24 hours a day. No frequent replacements or monthly treatments are required",
    "【Safe & Comfortable Design】Our dog flea collar prioritizes safety and comfort. Crafted with natural plant-derived ingredients (Lavender oil, Lemon eucalyptus oil, and Linaloe oil), it effectively repels fleas and ticks without synthetic pesticides or harmful chemicals. Made of soft material with smooth rounded edges, it minimizes skin friction and ensures superior wearing comfort for dogs",
    "【Waterproof & Durable】Designed specifically for dogs' active lifestyles, our non-greasy flea collar leaves no residue on their fur. Its waterproof feature maintains effectiveness during baths, rainy walks, and outdoor play, delivering continuous protection through all of your dog's daily activities",
    "【One Size Fits All Dogs】This flexible collar is specifically designed for dogs' comfort. Suitable for all dog breeds and sizes—small, medium, and large dogs alike. As dogs' sizes change as they grow, an adjustable collar is essential. Our dog flea and tick prevention collar is flexible and adjustable, with a maximum length of 25.6 inches, fitting dogs over 12 weeks old. It’s a must-have for every pup, especially during flea season"
  ],
